{"ticker":"IBKR","updated":"2026-10-23T23:06:31Z","profile":{"longName":"Interactive Brokers Group, Inc.","shortName":"Interactive Brokers Group, Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Capital Markets","country":"United States","website":"https://www.interactivebrokers.com","fullTimeEmployees":3182,"marketCap":136782307328,"trailingPE":30.641222,"forwardPE":24.131805,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":19.379755,"pegRatio":1.17,"targetMeanPrice":104.6625,"targetHighPrice":120.0,"targetLowPrice":75.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.135,"earningsGrowth":0.169,"grossMargins":0.92661005,"operatingMargins":0.77695,"profitMargins":0.16676001,"totalRevenue":7057999872,"beta":1.37,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":98.75,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":58.95,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.43},"summary":"Interactive Brokers Group, Inc. operates as an automated electronic broker in the United States and internationally. The company engages in the execution, clearance, and settlement of trades in stocks, options, futures, foreign exchange instruments, bonds, precious metals, and cryptocurrencies; and the company provides custody, prime brokerage, securities, and margin lending services. It also offers custody and service accounts for hedge and mutual funds, ETFs, registered investment advisors, proprietary trading groups, introducing brokers, and individual investors. In addition, the company provides trading platforms, including IBKR Trader Workstation, IBKR Desktop, IBKR Mobile, and IBKR Client Portal platform, as well as IBKR GlobalTrader mobile application, and IBKR APIs, builds custom trading applications and automates any part of the trading process. Further, it offers IBKR Pro, IBKR Lite, IBKR Universal Account, insured bank deposit sweep program, investors' marketplace, mutual fund marketplace, bond marketplace, forecast and event contracts, fractional trading, no transaction fee program for exchange-traded funds, overnight trading hours, and karta visa infinite charge card. It serves institutional and individual customers through electronic exchanges and market centers. Interactive Brokers Group, Inc. was founded in 1977 and is headquartered in Greenwich, Connecticut.","summary_zh":"Interactive Brokers Group, Inc. 在美國和國際上作為自動化電子經紀商運作。該公司從事股票、選擇權、期貨、外匯工具、債券、貴金屬和加密貨幣交易的執行、清算和結算；該公司提供託管、大宗經紀、證券和保證金借貸服務。它還為對沖基金和共同基金、ETF、註冊投資顧問、自營交易集團、介紹經紀人和個人投資者提供託管和服務帳戶。此外，該公司還提供交易平台，包括IBKR交易者工作站、IBKR桌面、IBKR行動和IBKR用戶端平台，以及IBKR GlobalTrader行動應用程式和IBKR API，建立自訂交易應用程式並自動化交易流程的任何部分。此外，它還提供IBKR Pro、IBKR Lite、IBKR通用帳戶、受保銀行存款清算計劃、投資者市場、共同基金市場、債券市場、預測和事件合約、分數交易、交易所交易基金無交易費計劃、隔夜交易時間和karta Visa無限充值卡。它透過電子交易所和市場中心為機構和個人客戶提供服務。盈透證券集團 (Interactive Brokers Group, Inc.) 成立於 1977 年，總部位於康乃狄克州格林威治。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"資本市場","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":62.39,"h":63.23,"l":62.15,"c":62.76,"v":5090200},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":64.5,"h":64.5,"l":61.85,"c":63.3,"v":12322400},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":62.58,"h":62.75,"l":61.16,"c":61.79,"v":98998600},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":62.48,"h":62.96,"l":62.01,"c":62.78,"v":8207000},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":62.48,"h":62.81,"l":61.64,"c":62.24,"v":6085000},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":61.3,"h":63.91,"l":60.79,"c":63.9,"v":7413900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":63.95,"h":64.27,"l":63.17,"c":63.95,"v":5778600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":64.1,"h":64.77,"l":63.87,"c":64.28,"v":5551800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":64.1,"h":64.22,"l":59.94,"c":60.16,"v":11597800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":60.83,"h":61.67,"l":60.78,"c":61.11,"v":5544900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":60.86,"h":62.44,"l":60.66,"c":62.21,"v":4619700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":62.43,"h":62.95,"l":62.0,"c":62.51,"v":3824700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":62.53,"h":63.79,"l":62.28,"c":63.34,"v":3946400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":63.3,"h":64.43,"l":63.03,"c":63.7,"v":3396700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":63.82,"h":64.33,"l":62.21,"c":62.25,"v":4073800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":62.25,"h":62.72,"l":61.56,"c":62.48,"v":4098800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":62.56,"h":63.09,"l":61.26,"c":62